                    <div class="serviceDescription">
                        <div class="servicesHeading">Stoneworks</div>
                        <div class="serviceInfo">Elevate your landscape with our premium custom stoneworks. We blend architectural elegance with enduring strength, crafting stunning retaining walls, luxurious patios, and bespoke outdoor living spaces. Each stone is meticulously selected and expertly placed, ensuring a timeless, natural finish that seamlessly integrates with your home and withstands harsh weather conditions.</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="services">
                    <div class="serviceDescription">
                        <div class="servicesHeading">Driveway</div>
                        <div class="serviceInfo">Your driveway is the grand entrance to your property. We engineer heavy duty concrete driveways designed to support immense weight while maintaining a flawless, polished appearance. From classic broomed finishes to intricate stamped designs, we deliver unparalleled durability, instantly boosting your curb appeal and providing a lasting, solid structural foundation.</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="serviceImage">
                        <img src="/static/images/background/enhanced/driveway.png" alt="">
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="services">
                    <div class="serviceImage">
                        <img src="/static/images/background/enhanced/pavement.png" alt="">
                    </div>
                    <div class="serviceDescription">
                        <div class="servicesHeading">Sidewalk</div>
                        <div class="serviceInfo">Create safe, beautiful pedestrian walkways with our professional sidewalk installation services. We pour solid, perfectly leveled sidewalks designed to endure heavy foot traffic and extreme seasonal weather changes. Our precise finishing techniques prevent hazardous tripping risks, providing a secure, attractive path that perfectly complements your landscaping and surrounding exterior architecture.</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="services">
                    <div class="serviceDescription">
                        <div class="servicesHeading">Pavement</div>
                        <div class="serviceInfo">We construct resilient pavement solutions engineered for maximum performance and longevity. Whether for commercial parking lots or residential pathways, our expert pouring techniques guarantee smooth, even surfaces that resist cracking and shifting. Trust our dedicated team to deliver high quality paving that enhances safety, accessibility, and overall property value effortlessly.</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="serviceImage">
                        <img src="/static/images/background/enhanced/pavement2.png" alt="">
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="services">
                    <div class="serviceImage">
                        <img src="/static/images/background/enhanced/indoor.png" alt="">
                    </div>
                    <div class="serviceDescription">
                        <div class="servicesHeading">Concrete Works</div>
                        <div class="serviceInfo">In structural and decorative concrete works, we bring your most ambitious architectural visions to life. From robust foundations to beautiful epoxy floors, our masterful craftsmanship ensures exceptional strength and precise detailing. We utilize premium materials to create permanent, flawless structures built to last for many generations ahead.</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
